<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Swiss market index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Swiss market index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA. New York, Frankfurt branch, has issued nine million American-style call and put warrants, in six equal tranches, on the Swiss Market index, lead manager Citibank (Swittzerland)x said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	18.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	20.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   EBS			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRIKE	 ISSUE</p>
<p> CALL	 3700	   3.25 CHF</p>
<p> PUT	  3700	   1.82 CHF</p>
<p> CALL	 3900	   2.27 CHF</p>
<p> PUT	  3900	   2.82 CHF</p>
<p> CALL	 4100	   1.53 CHF</p>
<p> PUT	  4100	   4.09 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
